  "scope": [
    "B01-B09/B11 must all meet their existing exact manifests; failed/missing/resource-stopped cases block the gate and later cases remain NOT RUN. No criteria, native limits, retries or individual deadlines are relaxed.",
    "B07 uses the separately declared consistent planar mortar EQUATION formulation. Native TIE revision 1 remains rejected; no implicit replacement or weak springs.",
    "Product bonded solve scope: two independently meshed bodies, one full axis-aligned planar zero-gap unit-square interface and <=65 trace nodes on each side. Mesh coverage, equations, written-coefficient continuity, external balance and native-output gates are mandatory; necessary support rank is not stability proof.",
    "B08 is only a 10-micrometre axial zero-compliance gap experiment in both roles. Saved physical gaps remain BLOCKED for product solves; no gap shear/bending/rotation, adhesive/contact or general/scalable assembly claim.",
    "Inspect real reviewed-bond setup through native mesh/solve, signed full fields/partitioned smoothing, explicit physical probes, authoritative sections and same-physics two-mesh comparison; retain both original warnings and raw immutable artifacts.",
    "Linux synthetic local development only. Curved solving, multiple solver bonds and transformed bonded constraints remain unsupported. Windows/laptop/headed GPU/performance/usability and complete B10/B12+ suite remain M4/T028-T030 obligations.",
    "Engineering owner must review this exact scope, formulation and all required criteria hashes. Automated numerical passes or CI green do not grant M3 exit; no automatic progression to M4."
  ],
